%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'flowchart': {'htmlLabels': false}}}%%
flowchart TD
    START([START - at validate_output]) --> check4[Check 4 criteria\nhallucination + relevance\ncompleteness + coherence]

    check4 --> vstatus{validation_status}

    vstatus -->|pass| pass_path[Deliver response as-is]
    vstatus -->|partial_pass completeness fail only| caveat[Append disclosure caveat\nto response]
    caveat --> pass_path

    pass_path --> update_mem[update_memory\nappend turn to MongoDB]
    update_mem --> write_ltm[write_long_term_memory\nupsert semantic_facts + prefs]
    write_ltm --> sum_check{messages_since\nlast_summary\n> threshold?}
    sum_check -->|YES| summarize[summarize_history\nhigh-tier LLM\ncompress older turns]
    summarize --> audit
    sum_check -->|NO| audit[audit_log\nwrite to MongoDB]
    audit --> END1([END - response delivered])

    vstatus -->|fail_hallucination\nfail_relevance\nfail_completeness\nfail_coherence| retry_check1{retry_count\n< max_retries?}
    retry_check1 -->|YES| prepare_retry[prepare_retry\nappend validation_feedback\nincrement retry_count]
    prepare_retry --> redispatch[dispatch_agents\nre-run with feedback]
    redispatch --> remerge[merge_responses\nverify_citations\nvalidate_output]
    remerge -->|loop back| vstatus

    retry_check1 -->|NO exhausted| fallback[fallback_response\ngeneric Arabic fallback]
    fallback --> update_mem

    vstatus -->|validator_error LLM call failed| retry_check2{retry_count\n< max_retries?}
    retry_check2 -->|YES| prepare_retry
    retry_check2 -->|NO| fallback
